sequenceDiagram
    participant A
    participant B
    A->B: solid line
    A-->B: dotted line
    A->>B: arrow
    A-->>B: dotted arrow
    A<<->>B: both ways
    A<<-->>B: dotted both ways
    A-xB: cross
    A--xB: dotted cross
    A-)B: open
    A--)B: dotted open
    A-|\B: solid top
    A-|/B: solid bottom
    A-\\B: stick top
    A-//B: stick bottom
    B/|-A: reverse solid top
    B\|--A: reverse solid bottom, dotted
    A()->>B: central from
    A->>()B: central to
    B()->>()A: both central
